GCP + Terraform Interview Prep Questions asked in a recent interview

Sharing a curated list of technical questions I’ve been exploring recently while preparing for cloud and DevOps interviews. Hope it helps others in their journey too!

What are the GCP services you have worked with frequently?
What have you used for authentication — Service Accounts or Workload Identity Federation?
How can you authenticate Workload Identity with Terraform?
What will happen if a .json key file is compromised in Service Accounts?
What are the differences between Ansible and Terraform? Can we do the same thing with Ansible instead of Terraform?
What are the data types in Terraform?
Why should we use a state file in Terraform?
Can we create Terraform configuration files without a state file?
What is the working of terraform.lock.hcl?
What are the IAM role types in GCP?
Can we do the same work with local_exec that Ansible does?
How can we validate what patterns are being given as input in Terraform?
Can we use lists with for_each in Terraform?
How can we prevent destroying the 15 resources that were created manually?
Suppose you want to create 10 instances via Terraform and configure one using local_exec. Will it impact other resources' provisioning?
How do you define a .tfvars file in Terraform?
